        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Oi! Where are Folinic and Tatjana?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "They, I think they're still at Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Did I not just ask if they all routed?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Er! S- sorry, sir! But Folinic and Tatjana should be alright. They've saved many lives!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "What do you mean they'll be alright? The insurgents have control of our town's defenses, we have no regular troops, and\u2014\u2014*cough* *cough* *cough*!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014*cough*, get some heavies and come with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "But they have firepower, and maybe hostages. We shouldn't provoke them any more. Let's wait for a chance to parley."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "A chance? You're going to wait for the enemy to give you a chance? Have you ever fought a battle?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "S-sorry!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1#2",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "But his concerns are reasonable. The active Originium left behind by the Great Rift are likely still in the foundation of Wolumonde. The consequences of letting them destroy it would be unthinkable."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_068"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Where did you come from? You shouldn't be here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "With no Gendarmerie, we're the ones who shouldn't be here... I've seen you before, Rhodes Island Operators."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Thank you for understanding. Ayerscarpe?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "A quick, on-the-spot assessment: if they continue to bombard the area with that device, we have ten to thirty minutes before Wolumonde comes to a halt."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "The best way to handle this would be to sever the link between this district and the rest of the city, but Wolumonde is no nomadic city. Individual districts do not have the power to move autonomously."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Actually, a tractor could do it... But not when the streets are full of rebels."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Is there an application procedure for an armed intervention?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "...Go nuts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "And please... Be sure to save Tatjana and Folinic."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
