    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Mr. Severin, we need\u2014 Ah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "...Lisa?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Is... is that Operator GreyThroat? And who's this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Operator Ayerscarpe, bodyguard of Catastrophe Messenger Leonhardt. He is out on another mission, so I got dragged over here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Lisa, where are Atro and Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Miss Folinic is still in there! But Miss Atro... she's... um..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "It's okay. I understand. I just had to be sure... We'll talk about it later."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Mmm... It's, it's nice to have some senior operators coming to help..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "B-but I still need to stay focused!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "I'll take care of the wounded. Whatever you do, please bring Miss Folinic back safely!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Right. I will."
    },
